# Bot1 has Rest in Peace out on turn 1. Bot2 destroys it with Disenchant on turn 4. Rest in Peace is put into the graveyard
# only after it is gone from the battlefield, so it is exiled (CR 614.1a, 400.7) - the replacement applies as it leaves, per
# its rulings. Disenchant, which finishes resolving after Rest in Peace has left, goes to Bot2's graveyard normally.

